{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01739",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.7,
      "end_seconds": 4.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "hello? Doctor? I was told to come in"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.35,
      "end_seconds": 11.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 12.02,
      "end_seconds": 21.41,
      "duration_seconds": 9.39,
      "text": "Sorry, um, what was I saying, doctor, I'm just here to help with the details."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.76,
      "end_seconds": 25.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Right, absolutely, come and sit beside them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 27.76,
      "end_seconds": 36.71,
      "duration_seconds": 8.95,
      "text": "Let me think, doctor, it's tingling in my thumb and first fingers. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.3,
      "end_seconds": 41.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.16,
      "end_seconds": 51.14,
      "duration_seconds": 8.98,
      "text": "Hmm, uh, probably about a week. Yeah. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.72,
      "end_seconds": 53.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "What eases it, if anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.74,
      "end_seconds": 59.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Shaking the hand helps a bit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.24,
      "end_seconds": 62.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.77,
      "end_seconds": 85.61,
      "duration_seconds": 21.84,
      "text": "Dropping things goes along with it, most of the time. I've, I've also been waking at night with numb hands, since yesterday. As for Dropping things, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.1,
      "end_seconds": 86.8,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Ah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.16,
      "end_seconds": 112.59,
      "duration_seconds": 7.43,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any neck pain, weakness in the legs or pain in the shoulder?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.05,
      "end_seconds": 118.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "No, uh, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.7,
      "end_seconds": 121.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.49,
      "end_seconds": 126.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "I mean, I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.58,
      "end_seconds": 129.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 133.34,
      "end_seconds": 138.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "It's sertraline, 50 milligrams, once a day, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.74,
      "end_seconds": 145.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "Oh, I used to take mirtazapine, but I stopped it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.28,
      "end_seconds": 149.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.89,
      "end_seconds": 153.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "No, never."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.32,
      "end_seconds": 158.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.06,
      "end_seconds": 167.58,
      "duration_seconds": 8.52,
      "text": "Depression, for about ten years. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.4,
      "end_seconds": 175.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "Ah. Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.3,
      "end_seconds": 179.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "no, I'm not allergic to anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.82,
      "end_seconds": 190.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.38,
      "end_seconds": 194.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.22,
      "end_seconds": 199.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.81,
      "end_seconds": 204.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.57,
      "end_seconds": 207.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.68,
      "end_seconds": 215.39,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.38,
      "end_seconds": 218.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "So, how active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.07,
      "end_seconds": 223.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.19,
      "end_seconds": 229.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Alright, shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.58,
      "end_seconds": 246.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Right, bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.18,
      "end_seconds": 274.45,
      "duration_seconds": 9.27,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 109 over 73, respiratory rate 16. And pulse 68, temp 36.6 degrees, SpO2 97 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.0,
      "end_seconds": 279.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.04,
      "end_seconds": 282.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.78,
      "end_seconds": 307.12,
      "duration_seconds": 7.34,
      "text": "Tapping over the wrist brings on the tingling and the thumb muscle is slightly thin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.29,
      "end_seconds": 310.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "You can relax now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.47,
      "end_seconds": 332.29,
      "duration_seconds": 9.82,
      "text": "Putting it all together, this looks most like carpal tunnel syndrome. We shouldn't forget a pinched nerve in the neck."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.99,
      "end_seconds": 335.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.25,
      "end_seconds": 365.52,
      "duration_seconds": 28.27,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like carpal tunnel syndrome, but I'd like to confirm. I think a nerve conduction study makes sense here, for carpal tunnel. Wear a wrist splint at night. I'm going to send a referral to the hand clinic. The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency. See me again in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 367.0,
      "end_seconds": 369.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Good, I'll return then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 371.46,
      "end_seconds": 374.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 376.75,
      "end_seconds": 380.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Uh, alright, thanks, take care."
    }
  ]
}